{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_w5bah2qsbirernjz6l6n7jeeviqugkuuoldpb5et3eteffca3wsq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01V4ae2W97axhwcrB1mogsd8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> tests/common/mod.rs <<'EOF'\n\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Reference replay of the C `mp3d_scale_pcm`.\n//\n// Used (a) to cross-check the value the two `.so`s agree on and (b) as the\n// baseline in `tests/equivalence.rs`. It is itself validated against the real C\n// `.so` over all 2^32 single-tap inputs by\n// `exhaustive_reference_model_matches_the_c_so`.\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n/// ```c\n/// static int16_t mp3d_scale_pcm(float sample) {\n///     if (sample >= 32766.5)  return (int16_t)32767;\n///     if (sample <= -32767.5) return (int16_t)-32768;\n///     int16_t s = (int16_t)(sample + .5f);\n///     s -= (s < 0);\n///     return s;\n/// }\n/// ```\npub fn c_scale_pcm_reference(sample: f32) -> i16 {\n    if sample as f64 >= 32766.5 {\n        return 32767;\n    }\n    if sample as f64 <= -32767.5 {\n        return -32768;\n    }\n    let s = (sample + 0.5f32) as i32 as i16;\n    s.wrapping_sub((s < 0) as i16)\n}\nEOF\npython3 - <<'PY'\np='tests/errors.rs'\ns=open(p).read()\nold = '''/// Literal replay of `c_src/src/lib.c`'s `mp3d_scale_pcm`, used only to\n/// cross-check the value both `.so`s agree on.\nfn c_scale_pcm_reference(sample: f32) -> i16 {\n    if sample as f64 >= 32766.5 {\n        return 32767;\n    }\n    if sample as f64 <= -32767.5 {\n        return -32768;\n    }\n    let s = (sample + 0.5f32) as i32 as i16;\n    s.wrapping_sub((s < 0) as i16)\n}\n'''\nassert old in s, \"pattern not found\"\ns = s.replace(old, '')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint(\"removed duplicate from errors.rs\")\nPY\ngrep -c \"c_scale_pcm_reference\" tests/errors.rs tests/common/mod.rs","description":"Move reference model into common module"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":159881,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":159881,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0030706e-f804-442b-bab0-f45e3401f2db","uuid":"7ebfd404-f50d-43e8-9a0b-c2f0d988f300","timestamp":"2026-08-27T01:38:36.941Z"}
